1
00:00:00,994 --> 00:00:02,494
How serious were you two'?

2
00:00:03,196 --> 00:00:04,866
(Raj:)Well, to be honest,

3
00:00:05,031 --> 00:00:08,241
(Raj:)we only went on four dates,
hugged twice, kissed once,

4
00:00:08,401 --> 00:00:11,401
(Raj:)and there was a handshake
loaded with sexual innuendo.

5
00:00:15,075 --> 00:00:18,855
Wait, a girl you never slept with
sent you an email

6
00:00:19,012 --> 00:00:21,652
(Emily:)and you felt so guilty about it
that you had to tell me?

7
00:00:21,815 --> 00:00:23,195
(Penny:)Yeah.

8
00:00:23,383 --> 00:00:24,763
(Emily:)That's kind of adorable.

9
00:00:25,919 --> 00:00:28,699
(Raj:)Are you sure?
Because this is the part of the night

10
00:00:28,855 --> 00:00:31,195
(Raj:)where I've said something stupid
and the girl usually leaves.

11
00:00:31,358 --> 00:00:32,858
(Emily:)I'm still here.

12
00:00:33,026 --> 00:00:35,566
(Raj:)Yeah, but now you make me wonder
what's wrong with you.

13
00:00:37,898 --> 00:00:39,238
(Emily:)We just met.

14
00:00:39,399 --> 00:00:41,879
(Emily:)You don't need to tell me about
other people you're seeing.

15
00:00:42,402 --> 00:00:43,852
(Raj:)Really?

16
00:00:44,004 --> 00:00:45,674
Because "I'm dating two women"

17
00:00:45,839 --> 00:01:00,019
(Raj:)is basically the only cool thing
I can say about myself.

